### Vector of ratios

For \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratios "bessel_i_ratios()":
- Measured maximum error: 13.8 ulp (4.7 ulp for \f$R_j > 10^{-3}\f$), 2.3 ulp1 on both gcc and CUDA.
- Test bounds: 23.0 ulp, 3.0 ulp1 (`tests/math/test_bessel.cpp`).
- Agreement with \f$A(k)\f$ for \f$m = 1\f$: within \f$2 \times 10^{-15}\f$ relative (tested at \f$k = 2, 100, 1000, 10^4, 10^5\f$ only).

### Timings

Measured in nanoseconds per call on one gcc thread, OpenMP (16 threads), and CUDA (RTX 4070 SUPER):
- `log_bessel_i0`: 65 / 5.1 / 0.72 ns/call.
- `log_bessel_i0_scaled`: 64 / 5.0 / 0.72 ns/call.
- `bessel_i_ratio`: 60 / 5.6 / 3.8 ns/call.
- `bessel_i_ratio_d1` through `bessel_i_ratio_d6`: 290–495 / 28–47 / 18–26 ns/call.
- `bessel_i_ratio_inv`: 609 / 54 / 39 ns/call.
- `bessel_i_ratio_inv_d1` through `bessel_i_ratio_inv_d6`: 292–542 / 29–50 / 16–25 ns/call.
- `bessel_i_ratios` (vector evaluation): 182 ns/call on one gcc thread (\f$k \in (0, 50)\f$); 11.8 ns/call on CUDA for \f$k \in (0, 50)\f$ and 67 ns/call for \f$k \in (500, 1000)\f$.

## Example

The following example evaluates \f$\log I_0(k)\f$, \f$A(k)\f$, and \f$K(\rho)\f$ inside a `Kokkos::parallel_for` kernel:

\code{.cpp}
#include <laplace/math/bessel_i.hpp>
#include <Kokkos_Core.hpp>

void compute_bessel_i(const Kokkos::View<const double*>& k,
                      const Kokkos::View<const double*>& rho,
                      Kokkos::View<double*>& log_i0,
                      Kokkos::View<double*>& ratio,
                      Kokkos::View<double*>& inv,
                      int n) {
  Kokkos::parallel_for("eval_bessel_i", n, KOKKOS_LAMBDA(const int i) {
    const double k_val   = k(i);
    const double rho_val = rho(i);
    log_i0(i) = laplace::math::log_bessel_i0(k_val);
    ratio(i)  = laplace::math::bessel_i_ratio(k_val);
    inv(i)    = laplace::math::bessel_i_ratio_inv(rho_val);
  });
}
\endcode

## Module functions

Functions in this module are called as `laplace::math::NAME`.

- \ref laplace::math::own::log_bessel_i0 "log_bessel_i0()" — \f$\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::log_bessel_i0_scaled "log_bessel_i0_scaled()" — \f$\log I_0(k) - k\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio "bessel_i_ratio()" — \f$A(k) = I_1(k)/I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d1 "bessel_i_ratio_d1()" — \f$A'(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^2}{\mathrm{d}k^2}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d2 "bessel_i_ratio_d2()" — \f$A''(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^3}{\mathrm{d}k^3}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d3 "bessel_i_ratio_d3()" — \f$A'''(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^4}{\mathrm{d}k^4}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d4 "bessel_i_ratio_d4()" — \f$A^{(4)}(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^5}{\mathrm{d}k^5}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d5 "bessel_i_ratio_d5()" — \f$A^{(5)}(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^6}{\mathrm{d}k^6}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_d6 "bessel_i_ratio_d6()" — \f$A^{(6)}(k) = \frac{\mathrm{d}^7}{\mathrm{d}k^7}\log I_0(k)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv "bessel_i_ratio_inv()" — \f$K(\rho) = A^{-1}(\rho)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d1 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d1()" — \f$K'(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d2 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d2()" — \f$K''(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d3 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d3()" — \f$K'''(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d4 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d4()" — \f$K^{(4)}(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d5 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d5()" — \f$K^{(5)}(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratio_inv_d6 "bessel_i_ratio_inv_d6()" — \f$K^{(6)}(\rho)\f$ at \f$\rho = A(\kappa)\f$
- \ref laplace::math::own::bessel_i_ratios "bessel_i_ratios()" — \f$I_j(k)/I_0(k)\f$ for \f$j = 1, \dots, m\f$

